# pop'n music 10: the five event-phase codes, typed in test mode > EVENT OPTIONS > PASSWORD
# (games/popn10/unlocks.toml). From a save at phase 0, it leaves one at MAX phase, with a snap of
# EVENT OPTIONS after each code:
#   hiraku-popn10 --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn10-phases.his
# Blue 6/4 turn the character wheel (0-9, A-Z; on 0 for a new code, then where the last
# character left it), red 5 enters. After the tenth character the game shows PHASE UPDATED and
# writes the save. At MAX, EVENT OPTIONS has no PASSWORD line.
